recommend check-in (Keaton) -- mantra/src/main.rye inlines a model mantra/src/weave.rye owns, and both cures cross the same seam: porting site into the CLI rewrites .mantra/'s on-disk record, and deleting the copy to import the module rewrites it too. The ceiling holds the line meanwhile and falls the lap either lands.
